{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-14"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811101-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그만 실수로 코르크 부스러기로 만든 지면의 함정에 빠져버린다. 이건 브레드 별의 *옛날 방식*을 고수하는 사냥꾼들의 방식이다. 몸을 일으키자 벌레 둥지 입구가 보인다","talkId":403811101,"textHash":"15370132391894171767","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811101","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"47d85ac329ba758d","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-18168437582868189974-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"「벌레 방울」을 하나 보관한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"18168437582868189974","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-18168437582868189974","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6218c2efc6fac0a5","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-17729441396556855920-effect"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-17729441396556855920-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"★1~2 「보존」 축복과 ★1~2 「번식」 축복을 1개씩 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"17729441396556855920","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-17729441396556855920","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6218c2efc6fac0a5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-18168437582868189974-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-14834037533463178461-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"곤충집에 들어가 놈들을 짓밟는다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"14834037533463178461","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-14834037533463178461","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"18c022aa5e868262","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-8282033229805246350-effect"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-8282033229805246350-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"곤충 떼 전투를 3회 진행하고 랜덤 ★1~2 축복 3개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"8282033229805246350","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-8282033229805246350","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"18c022aa5e868262","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-14834037533463178461-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-9811948224442634791-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"곤충집에 들어간다","talkId":null,"textHash":"9811948224442634791","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-9811948224442634791","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e79ed7f13a7d99b1","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-2339212749492303257-effect"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-2339212749492303257-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"모든 게 미지로 보인다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2339212749492303257","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-2339212749492303257","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e79ed7f13a7d99b1","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-9811948224442634791-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811103-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"천천히 곤충집 깊숙한 곳으로 들어간다. 거꾸로 매달린 알덩이를 밀어내자, 반투명의 벌레 알 안에서 태어난 새 생명이 촉수를 사용해 아직 감겨 있는 겹눈을 비비는 것을 발견한다","talkId":403811103,"textHash":"7122757550668751294","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811103","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"68bd6d995e2bda55","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811104-line"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811104-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 무수한 *벌레 알*로 쌓아 만든 왕좌 위에, 그가 깊이 잠들어 있는 기이하기 짝이 없는 광경을 목격한다","talkId":403811104,"textHash":"5195703915738929372","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811104","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"68bd6d995e2bda55","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811105-line"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811105-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"다시 눈을 깜빡하는 사이 하루가 지나간다. 「충황(蟲皇)」 타이츠론스가 잠들어 있는 그 광경을 끊임없이 목격하며 당신은 그가 눈을 뜨고 자신을 봐주기를 희망한다","talkId":403811105,"textHash":"12412632400361706090","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811105","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"68bd6d995e2bda55","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811106-line"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811106-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"첫 번째 벌레 알에서 생명이 알을 깨고 밖으로 나온다","talkId":403811106,"textHash":"4372672984042762164","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811106","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"68bd6d995e2bda55","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811110-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"이윽고 머릿속으로 목소리가 들려온다…… 타█이츠█ ██로█ █스██…… 오랜 기다림이 당신을 무너뜨렸고, 당신은 황급히 그곳을 빠져나가려 한다","talkId":403811110,"textHash":"4633665691684402843","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811110","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"64b021c63dd9b8b2","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-16506306938017741000-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"둥지 입구에서 발걸음을 멈춘다","talkId":null,"textHash":"16506306938017741000","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-16506306938017741000","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"710fae700c6f3aba","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-15771047244338812883-effect"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-15771047244338812883-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"섣불리 모험하지 말자","talkId":null,"textHash":"15771047244338812883","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/text-15771047244338812883","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"710fae700c6f3aba","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811112-line"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-16506306938017741000-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811112-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"자신의 인생은 탐험이 필요하지 않다고 믿는다. 물론 그보다 더 중요한 건 곤충집 속에서 타█이츠█ ██로█ █스██ 의█ █자손█과 ██ █마주치지█않█는 것█……","talkId":403811112,"textHash":"10858905903445891582","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811112","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"710fae700c6f3aba","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811113-line"],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811113-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-14","missionId":"event-rogue-14","mission":"곤충집","scene":"곤충집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"약간의 우주 조각을 획득하였다","talkId":403811113,"textHash":"13595859018016283136","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:14/talk-403811113","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"710fae700c6f3aba","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"虫巢","bwikiRevision":58246,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8731","bwikiMission":"곤충집"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811101-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-18168437582868189974-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-17729441396556855920-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-14834037533463178461-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-8282033229805246350-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-9811948224442634791-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-2339212749492303257-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811103-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811104-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811105-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811106-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811110-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-16506306938017741000-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-text-15771047244338812883-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811112-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-14-talk-403811113-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":16,"reviewRows":0,"segments":7,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}